==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[martial]] [[art]]}}

# Commonly, any of several fighting styles which contain systematised methods of training for combat, both armed and unarmed; often practised as a sport, e.g. [[boxing]], [[karate]], [[judo]], [[wrestling]], or [[Muay Thai]].
# Can also included military tactics such as infantry  manoeuvres, aerial combat, and so on.

